      "id": "8c7e391fadb34d09",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -5119,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三.市场利率的影响因素(Influencing Factors of Market Interest Rates)**"
    },
    {
      "id": "708a8a8d43e743f3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -5009,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**三.年金终值和现值**"
    },
    {
